explanation:
```js
const session = client.startSession();
try {
  await session.withTransaction(async () => {
    await wallets.updateOne({ userId, balance: { $gte: 2999 } }, { $inc: { balance: -2999 } }, { session });
    await orders.insertOne({ userId, status: 'paid' }, { session });
  });
} finally {
  await session.endSession();
}
```
`withTransaction` retries on transient errors, so keep side effects like emails outside the callback.
